+// The extents of the prism-extents spike (kernel spec section 8.5): a prism of a planar profile up
+// to a face of a body or up to the body, and a tapered prism, by each construction the spike
+// compares. Up to a face: BRepFeat_MakePrism, or a prism through the body split at the face's
+// surface by BRepAlgoAPI_Splitter. Up to the body: the same two, with the body in place of the
+// face (`up_to_body`, which the rib spike reuses). Taper: BRepFeat_MakeDPrism,
+// BRepOffsetAPI_DraftAngle on a prism's lateral faces, or BRepOffsetAPI_ThruSections between the
+// profile and its offset. The spike's indicator records when it is polled (section 8.1 item 4).
